From 7c07d53decc57337f1decca3643981ef62b54d2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 13:47:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] v2.9.7: stage four upstream 3006.102.9 pull-forwards for test
 build

Cherry-picked from Asuswrt-Merlin (RMerl/asuswrt-merlin.ng) ahead of the
102.9 release, each with its upstream author preserved:
- tor 0.4.9.11 (Eric "Merlin" Sauvageau) - the Tor network rejects <0.4.9
  relays/clients from 2026-09-01
- Tor IPv6 transparent-proxy anti-leak (Eric "Merlin" Sauvageau)
- Brahma-B53 Spectre/Meltdown mitigation whitelists (leonpano2006) -
  KPTI off on B53, three mainline Broadcom commits transplanted
- OpenSSL 1.1.1 CMS + DTLS CVE backports (RSDNTWK)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src-rt/version.conf | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src-rt/version.conf b/release/src-rt/version.conf
index bc7d73a3cb..553d2f1afd 100644
--- a/release/src-rt/version.conf
+++ b/release/src-rt/version.conf
@@ -4,6 +4,6 @@ KERNEL_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(KERNEL_VER))
 FS_VER_AM=$(subst .,,$(FS_VER))
 
 SERIALNO=102.8
-EXTENDNO=Reaper_v2.9.6
+EXTENDNO=Reaper_v2.9.7
 
 RCNO=0
